1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,660
When you send a message across the world, it doesn't go to

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:03,960
space,

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,240
it goes under the sea.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,240
Almost all the data between continents travels through

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,760
cables on the ocean floor.

6
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:16,160
Some are no thicker than a garden hose, hundreds of them

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,380
stretching more than a million kilometers.

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,240
The internet isn't in the cloud, it's in the ocean.
